# An allowlist: the build context is ONLY what the app reads at runtime.
# Anything new in this folder stays out of the image until it is listed here,
# so a recording dropped in media/ (gigabytes) or a .env with live keys can
# never ship by accident, and `fly deploy` never uploads them to the builder.
*
!app.py
!requirements.txt
!backend
!data
!web

# ...minus the bytecode Python leaves inside them.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
